{"v":[{"a":["لَآ","أُقۡسِمُ","بِيَوۡمِ","ٱلۡقِيَٰمَةِ"],"t":"I swear by the Day of Resurrection","l":"La 'Uqsimu Biyawmi Al-Qiyamahi","w":[["lā","Nay"],["uq'simu","I swear"],["biyawmi","by (the) Day"],["l-qiyāmati","(of) the Resurrection"]]},{"a":["وَلَآ","أُقۡسِمُ","بِٱلنَّفۡسِ","ٱللَّوَّامَةِ"],"t":"And I swear by the blaming soul","l":"Wa La 'Uqsimu Bin-Nafsi Al-Lawwamahi","w":[["walā","And nay"],["uq'simu","I swear"],["bil-nafsi","by the soul"],["l-lawāmati","self-accusing"]]},{"a":["أَيَحۡسَبُ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","أَلَّن","نَّجۡمَعَ","عِظَامَهُۥ"],"t":"Does man think that We will not reassemble his bones","l":"Ayahsabu Al-'Insanu 'Allan Najma`a `Izamahu","w":[["ayaḥsabu","Does think"],["l-insānu","[the] man"],["allan","that not"],["najmaʿa","We will assemble"],["ʿiẓāmahu","his bones"]]},{"a":["بَلَىٰ","قَٰدِرِينَ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَن","نُّسَوِّيَ","بَنَانَهُۥ"],"t":"Yes indeed; We are Able to reconstruct his fingertips","l":"Bala Qadirina `Ala 'An Nusawwiya Bananahu","w":[["balā","Nay"],["qādirīna","(We are) Able"],["ʿalā","on"],["an","that"],["nusawwiya","We can restore"],["banānahu","his fingertips"]]},{"a":["بَلۡ","يُرِيدُ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","لِيَفۡجُرَ","أَمَامَهُۥ"],"t":"But man wants to deny what is ahead of him","l":"Bal Yuridu Al-'Insanu Liyafjura 'Amamahu","w":[["bal","Nay"],["yurīdu","Desires"],["l-insānu","[the] man"],["liyafjura","to give (the) lie"],["amāmahu","(to) what is before him"]]},{"a":["يَسۡـَٔلُ","أَيَّانَ","يَوۡمُ","ٱلۡقِيَٰمَةِ"],"t":"He asks, “When is the Day of Resurrection?”","l":"Yas'alu 'Ayyana Yawmu Al-Qiyamahi","w":[["yasalu","He asks"],["ayyāna","When"],["yawmu","(is the) Day"],["l-qiyāmati","(of) the Resurrection"]]},{"a":["فَإِذَا","بَرِقَ","ٱلۡبَصَرُ"],"t":"When vision is dazzled","l":"Fa'idha Bariqa Al-Basaru","w":[["fa-idhā","So when"],["bariqa","is dazzled"],["l-baṣaru","the vision"]]},{"a":["وَخَسَفَ","ٱلۡقَمَرُ"],"t":"And the moon is eclipsed","l":"Wa Khasafa Al-Qamaru","w":[["wakhasafa","And becomes dark"],["l-qamaru","the moon"]]},{"a":["وَجُمِعَ","ٱلشَّمۡسُ","وَٱلۡقَمَرُ"],"t":"And the sun and the moon are joined together","l":"Wa Jumi`a Ash-Shamsu Wa Al-Qamaru","w":[["wajumiʿa","And are joined"],["l-shamsu","the sun"],["wal-qamaru","and the moon"]]},{"a":["يَقُولُ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","يَوۡمَئِذٍ","أَيۡنَ","ٱلۡمَفَرُّ"],"t":"On that Day, man will say, “Where is the escape?”","l":"Yaqulu Al-'Insanu Yawma'idhin 'Ayna Al-Mafarru","w":[["yaqūlu","Will say"],["l-insānu","[the] man"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["ayna","Where"],["l-mafaru","(is) the escape"]]},{"a":["كَلَّا","لَا","وَزَرَ"],"t":"No indeed! There is no refuge","l":"Kalla La Wazara","w":[["kallā","By no means"],["lā","(There is) no"],["wazara","refuge"]]},{"a":["إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكَ","يَوۡمَئِذٍ","ٱلۡمُسۡتَقَرُّ"],"t":"To your Lord on that Day is the settlement","l":"Ila Rabbika Yawma'idhin Al-Mustaqarru","w":[["ilā","To"],["rabbika","your Lord"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["l-mus'taqaru","(is) the place of rest"]]},{"a":["يُنَبَّؤُاْ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","يَوۡمَئِذِۭ","بِمَا","قَدَّمَ","وَأَخَّرَ"],"t":"On that Day man will be informed of everything he put forward, and everything he left behind","l":"Yunabba'u Al-'Insanu Yawma'idhin Bima Qaddama Wa 'Akhkhara","w":[["yunabba-u","Will be informed"],["l-insānu","[the] man"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["bimā","of what"],["qaddama","he sent forth"],["wa-akhara","and kept back"]]},{"a":["بَلِ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","عَلَىٰ","نَفۡسِهِۦ","بَصِيرَةٞ"],"t":"And man will be evidence against himself","l":"Bali Al-'Insanu `Ala Nafsihi Basirahun","w":[["bali","Nay"],["l-insānu","[The] man"],["ʿalā","against"],["nafsihi","himself"],["baṣīratun","(will be) a witness"]]},{"a":["وَلَوۡ","أَلۡقَىٰ","مَعَاذِيرَهُۥ"],"t":"Even as he presents his excuses","l":"Wa Law 'Alqa Ma`adhirahu","w":[["walaw","Even if"],["alqā","he presents"],["maʿādhīrahu","his excuses"]]},{"a":["لَا","تُحَرِّكۡ","بِهِۦ","لِسَانَكَ","لِتَعۡجَلَ","بِهِۦٓ"],"t":"Do not wag your tongue with it, to hurry on with it","l":"La Tuharrik Bihi Lisanaka Lita`jala Bihi","w":[["lā","Not"],["tuḥarrik","move"],["bihi","with it"],["lisānaka","your tongue"],["litaʿjala","to hasten"],["bihi","with it"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","عَلَيۡنَا","جَمۡعَهُۥ","وَقُرۡءَانَهُۥ"],"t":"Upon Us is its collection and its recitation","l":"Inna `Alayna Jam`ahu Wa Qur'anahu","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["ʿalaynā","upon Us"],["jamʿahu","(is) its collection"],["waqur'ānahu","and its recitation"]]},{"a":["فَإِذَا","قَرَأۡنَٰهُ","فَٱتَّبِعۡ","قُرۡءَانَهُۥ"],"t":"Then, when We have recited it, follow its recitation","l":"Fa'idha Qara'nahu Fa Attabi` Qur'anahu","w":[["fa-idhā","And when"],["qaranāhu","We have recited it"],["fa-ittabiʿ","then follow"],["qur'ānahu","its recitation"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","إِنَّ","عَلَيۡنَا","بَيَانَهُۥ"],"t":"Then upon Us is its explanation","l":"Thumma 'Inna `Alayna Bayanahu","w":[["thumma","Then"],["inna","indeed"],["ʿalaynā","upon Us"],["bayānahu","(is) its explanation"]]},{"a":["كَلَّا","بَلۡ","تُحِبُّونَ","ٱلۡعَاجِلَةَ"],"t":"Alas, you love the fleeting life","l":"Kalla Bal Tuhibbuna Al-`Ajilaha","w":[["kallā","No"],["bal","But"],["tuḥibbūna","you love"],["l-ʿājilata","the immediate"]]},{"a":["وَتَذَرُونَ","ٱلۡأٓخِرَةَ"],"t":"And you disregard the Hereafter","l":"Wa Tadharuna Al-'Akhiraha","w":[["watadharūna","And leave"],["l-ākhirata","the Hereafter"]]},{"a":["وُجُوهٞ","يَوۡمَئِذٖ","نَّاضِرَةٌ"],"t":"Faces on that Day will be radiant","l":"Wujuhun Yawma'idhin Nađirahun","w":[["wujūhun","Faces"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["nāḍiratun","(will be) radiant"]]},{"a":["إِلَىٰ","رَبِّهَا","نَاظِرَةٞ"],"t":"Looking towards their Lord","l":"Ila Rabbiha Nazirahun","w":[["ilā","Towards"],["rabbihā","their Lord"],["nāẓiratun","looking"]]},{"a":["وَوُجُوهٞ","يَوۡمَئِذِۭ","بَاسِرَةٞ"],"t":"And faces on that Day will be gloomy","l":"Wa Wujuhun Yawma'idhin Basirahun","w":[["wawujūhun","And faces"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["bāsiratun","(will be) distorted"]]},{"a":["تَظُنُّ","أَن","يُفۡعَلَ","بِهَا","فَاقِرَةٞ"],"t":"Realizing that a back-breaker has befallen them","l":"Tazunnu 'An Yuf`ala Biha Faqirahun","w":[["taẓunnu","Thinking"],["an","that"],["yuf'ʿala","will be done"],["bihā","to them"],["fāqiratun","backbreaking"]]},{"a":["كَلَّآ","إِذَا","بَلَغَتِ","ٱلتَّرَاقِيَ"],"t":"Indeed, when it has reached the breast-bones","l":"Kalla 'Idha Balaghati At-Taraqi","w":[["kallā","No"],["idhā","When"],["balaghati","it reaches"],["l-tarāqiya","the collar bones"]]},{"a":["وَقِيلَ","مَنۡۜ","رَاقٖ"],"t":"And it is said, “Who is the healer?”","l":"Wa Qila Man Raqin","w":[["waqīla","And it is said"],["man","Who"],["rāqin","(will) cure"]]},{"a":["وَظَنَّ","أَنَّهُ","ٱلۡفِرَاقُ"],"t":"And He realizes that it is the parting","l":"Wa Zanna 'Annahu Al-Firaqu","w":[["waẓanna","And he is certain"],["annahu","that it"],["l-firāqu","(is) the parting"]]},{"a":["وَٱلۡتَفَّتِ","ٱلسَّاقُ","بِٱلسَّاقِ"],"t":"And leg is entwined with leg","l":"Wa At-Taffati As-Saqu Bis-Saqi","w":[["wal-tafati","And is wound"],["l-sāqu","the leg"],["bil-sāqi","about the leg"]]},{"a":["إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكَ","يَوۡمَئِذٍ","ٱلۡمَسَاقُ"],"t":"To your Lord on that Day is the drive","l":"Ila Rabbika Yawma'idhin Al-Masaqu","w":[["ilā","To"],["rabbika","your Lord"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["l-masāqu","(will be) the driving"]]},{"a":["فَلَا","صَدَّقَ","وَلَا","صَلَّىٰ"],"t":"He neither believed nor prayed","l":"Fala Saddaqa Wa La Salla","w":[["falā","And not"],["ṣaddaqa","he accepted (the) truth"],["walā","and not"],["ṣallā","he prayed"]]},{"a":["وَلَٰكِن","كَذَّبَ","وَتَوَلَّىٰ"],"t":"But he denied and turned away","l":"Wa Lakin Kadhaba Wa Tawalla","w":[["walākin","But"],["kadhaba","he denied"],["watawallā","and turned away"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","ذَهَبَ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَهۡلِهِۦ","يَتَمَطَّىٰٓ"],"t":"Then he went to his family, full of pride","l":"Thumma Dhahaba 'Ila 'Ahlihi Yatamatta","w":[["thumma","Then"],["dhahaba","he went"],["ilā","to"],["ahlihi","his family"],["yatamaṭṭā","swaggering"]]},{"a":["أَوۡلَىٰ","لَكَ","فَأَوۡلَىٰ"],"t":"Woe to you; and woe","l":"Awla Laka Fa'awla","w":[["awlā","Woe"],["laka","to you"],["fa-awlā","and woe"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","أَوۡلَىٰ","لَكَ","فَأَوۡلَىٰٓ"],"t":"Then again: Woe to you; and woe","l":"Thumma 'Awla Laka Fa'awla","w":[["thumma","Then"],["awlā","woe"],["laka","to you"],["fa-awlā","and woe"]]},{"a":["أَيَحۡسَبُ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","أَن","يُتۡرَكَ","سُدًى"],"t":"Does man think that he will be left without purpose","l":"Ayahsabu Al-'Insanu 'An Yutraka Sudaan","w":[["ayaḥsabu","Does think"],["l-insānu","man"],["an","that"],["yut'raka","he will be left"],["sudan","neglected"]]},{"a":["أَلَمۡ","يَكُ","نُطۡفَةٗ","مِّن","مَّنِيّٖ","يُمۡنَىٰ"],"t":"Was he not a drop of ejaculated semen","l":"Alam Yaku Nutfatan Min Maniyin Yumna","w":[["alam","Was not"],["yaku","he"],["nuṭ'fatan","a semen-drop"],["min","of"],["maniyyin","semen"],["yum'nā","emitted"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","كَانَ","عَلَقَةٗ","فَخَلَقَ","فَسَوَّىٰ"],"t":"Then he became a clot. And He created and proportioned","l":"Thumma Kana `Alaqatan Fakhalaqa Fasawwa","w":[["thumma","Then"],["kāna","he was"],["ʿalaqatan","a clinging substance"],["fakhalaqa","then He created"],["fasawwā","and proportioned"]]},{"a":["فَجَعَلَ","مِنۡهُ","ٱلزَّوۡجَيۡنِ","ٱلذَّكَرَ","وَٱلۡأُنثَىٰٓ"],"t":"And made of him the two sexes, the male and the female","l":"Faja`ala Minhu Az-Zawjayni Adh-Dhakara Wa Al-'Untha","w":[["fajaʿala","Then made"],["min'hu","of him"],["l-zawjayni","two kinds"],["l-dhakara","(the) male"],["wal-unthā","and the female"]]},{"a":["أَلَيۡسَ","ذَٰلِكَ","بِقَٰدِرٍ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَن","يُحۡـِۧيَ","ٱلۡمَوۡتَىٰ"],"t":"Is He not Able to revive the dead","l":"Alaysa Dhalika Biqadirin `Ala 'An Yuhyiya Al-Mawta","w":[["alaysa","Is not"],["dhālika","[that]"],["biqādirin","(He) Able"],["ʿalā","[over]"],["an","to"],["yuḥ'yiya","give life"],["l-mawtā","(to) the dead"]]}]}